  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-excerpt\">\n    <p>New research shows people in New Zealand are increasingly turning to insurance brokers for help as concerns about natural hazard risks make general insurance more expensive and harder to secure.\nThe I...<\/p>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-unauthorized-message\">\n    <div class=\"mepr-wrapper\">\n<p>To continue reading the full article and get full access to the InsuranceAsia News platform, please enquire about a subscription.<\/p>\n<p>Your company may already have a corporate license in place.<\/p>\n<div class=\"mepr-button-wrap\">\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/subscribe\/\">Enquire Now<\/a><\/p>\n<div>OR<\/div>\n<p>      <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/register\/free-trial\/\" class=\"mepr_product_link mepr-product-link-63661\">Take a Free Trial<\/a>\n        <\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Already a Subscriber? Please <a href=\"https:\/\/insuranceasianews.com\/login\/\">Login<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n  <\/div>\n  <div class=\"mepr-login-form-wrap\">\n      <\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Over 90% of Insurance Brokers Association of New Zealand (IBANZ) brokers report increased demand for natural hazard insurance advice, while 60% say natural hazards and climate change making insurance harder to place.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":353,"featured_media":231032,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"companies_category":[],"subject":[99,190],"line_of_business":[],"topic":[],"coauthors":[542],"class_list":["post-231030","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","industry_segments-industry-associations","country-new-zealand","subject-catastrophe","subject-climate"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.6 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<